WEBVTT

00:00:23.910 --> 00:00:25.750
<i>Reppuzan!</i>

00:00:45.480 --> 00:00:48.610
I guess... it's inevitable...

00:00:52.190 --> 00:00:55.110
It seems the Yamato
reached its destination.

00:00:55.110 --> 00:01:00.950
Its safe arrival alone
justifies reforming the 501st.

00:01:01.490 --> 00:01:05.290
I'd heard that the objective was to reinforce our troops in this area.

00:01:05.660 --> 00:01:07.210
Is that not all?

00:01:08.250 --> 00:01:10.460
Listen, Lieutenant Colonel Minna.

00:01:10.880 --> 00:01:12.550
Operation Trajanus,

00:01:12.550 --> 00:01:15.800
our attempt to make contact with the Neuroi, failed.

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:19.140
Coexistence is no longer an option.

00:01:19.140 --> 00:01:21.850
Our only remaining choice
is whether we destroy them

00:01:21.850 --> 00:01:23.930
or allow them to destroy us.

00:01:23.930 --> 00:01:27.690
A strategy solely reliant
upon Witches won't suffice.

00:01:28.440 --> 00:01:30.310
That's what the Yamato is for?

00:01:30.730 --> 00:01:32.820
Enough of that.

00:01:32.820 --> 00:01:34.570
Come to think of it, Lieutenant Colonel,

00:01:34.570 --> 00:01:37.570
was there not a petition
for a new operation?

00:01:37.570 --> 00:01:38.700
Yes.

00:01:38.700 --> 00:01:42.080
A select group of Witches
will destroy the Neuroi.

00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:47.710
We have an idea as to how we might help with that operation.

00:01:48.790 --> 00:01:50.210
Come in.

00:01:55.420 --> 00:01:57.010
You're...

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:37.230
Get up, Hartmann!

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:44.700
So sleepy...

00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:46.120
Keep going.

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:48.080
There's no time left till the operation!

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:50.120
Huh? Operation?

00:03:50.120 --> 00:03:53.000
Minna's taking the petition
before the top brass right now.

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:56.170
Most likely, you and I
will be the ones fighting.

00:03:57.170 --> 00:03:58.460
The two of us?

00:04:08.390 --> 00:04:09.640
It's a transport plane.

00:04:09.640 --> 00:04:11.310
That's a Ju52.

00:04:11.680 --> 00:04:14.190
Looks like Commander Minna is back.

00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:21.190
She jumped out!

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:22.610
That's...

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:33.580
W-Wow!

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:38.500
Hey. Nice to meet you, kitties.

00:04:38.880 --> 00:04:39.750
Kitties?

00:04:44.010 --> 00:04:47.010
Sorry, I don't do autographs.

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:48.600
O-Oh.

00:04:49.970 --> 00:04:51.470
By the way...

00:04:51.470 --> 00:04:54.390
Marseille! Why are you here?

00:04:54.390 --> 00:04:56.440
You're supposed to be in Africa.

00:04:57.150 --> 00:05:00.150
Oh, hey, Hartmann! It's been so long!

00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:04.820
Since pilot training?

00:05:04.820 --> 00:05:08.910
No. It was the 4th company, in the JG 52!

00:05:08.910 --> 00:05:10.160
That's right!

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:12.620
Do you remember that one officer

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:14.450
who was so grouchy all the time?

00:05:14.450 --> 00:05:15.750
What was her name-

00:05:15.750 --> 00:05:16.670
Barkhorn!

00:05:16.670 --> 00:05:18.580
Ah, that's right.

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:20.250
It's been a while, Barkhorn.

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:22.170
How've you been?

00:05:24.260 --> 00:05:25.720
Been just fine.

00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:29.850
I wonder if that cool person is Barkhorn-san's friend.

00:05:29.850 --> 00:05:32.310
D-Doesn't look that way...

00:05:35.270 --> 00:05:37.810
<i>This one's gonna be difficult to deal with.</i>

00:05:44.440 --> 00:05:45.780
That's the woman we just met!

00:05:45.780 --> 00:05:46.780
Wow!

00:05:46.780 --> 00:05:48.530
She's in a book!

00:05:48.530 --> 00:05:49.950
Um...

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:57.960
Hanna Marseille, Captain of the Karlsland 31st Luftwaffe, the Storm Witches.

00:05:57.960 --> 00:06:00.330
A super-ace, with two hundred kills!

00:06:00.330 --> 00:06:03.340
Two hundred... Wow!

00:06:03.340 --> 00:06:05.210
And she's really beautiful,

00:06:05.210 --> 00:06:09.720
with fans all over the
world, not just in Karlsland.

00:06:09.720 --> 00:06:12.640
It says her nickname is the Star of Africa...

00:06:12.640 --> 00:06:14.390
The Star of Africa!

00:06:14.390 --> 00:06:15.720
How cool!

00:06:15.720 --> 00:06:17.770
I want her autograph.

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:20.270
She doesn't give autographs.

00:06:20.940 --> 00:06:24.360
Shirley-san, you know her?

00:06:24.360 --> 00:06:28.740
Lucchini and I spent some time in Africa before we came here.

00:06:28.740 --> 00:06:29.490
We did!

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:31.280
What kind of person is she?

00:06:31.660 --> 00:06:33.740
I've heard lots of rumors.

00:06:33.740 --> 00:06:35.080
We have! We have!

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:39.210
The others from Karlsland
would know her better.

00:06:39.870 --> 00:06:42.790
Come to think of it, she
said you were in her squad...

00:06:43.210 --> 00:06:45.630
Both Hartmann and I
were, back in Karlsland.

00:06:45.630 --> 00:06:48.300
Marseille was in our Air Force.

00:06:48.670 --> 00:06:50.680
So you're friends!

00:06:51.220 --> 00:06:52.590
We aren't friends at all!

00:06:52.590 --> 00:06:54.850
That show-off!

00:06:56.430 --> 00:06:57.810
Okay. Everyone, quiet!

00:06:59.060 --> 00:07:02.100
The two assigned Witches will charge in here.

00:07:02.100 --> 00:07:06.820
They'll defeat the escort Neuroi
and take out the core. That is all.

00:07:07.110 --> 00:07:09.150
Just two?

00:07:09.150 --> 00:07:12.860
We'll use a submarine to
approach the area of operations.

00:07:12.860 --> 00:07:16.540
It can only hold and launch two units.

00:07:16.540 --> 00:07:19.500
I'll announce the Witches
participating in this mission.

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:22.710
The first is here on loan from

00:07:22.710 --> 00:07:26.500
the 31st Luftwaffe, to help
support this operation,

00:07:26.500 --> 00:07:28.090
Captain Hanna Marseille.

00:07:28.460 --> 00:07:30.300
What is the meaning of
this, Lieutenant Colonel?

00:07:30.300 --> 00:07:32.510
The strike force was supposed to be Hartmann and me.

00:07:33.640 --> 00:07:35.550
It's orders from the top.

00:07:36.010 --> 00:07:39.560
Only one member from the 501st will be participating.

00:07:40.020 --> 00:07:42.440
That's you, Captain Barkhorn.

00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:43.480
Impossible!

00:07:43.980 --> 00:07:47.520
Barkhorn isn't good
enough to be my partner.

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:55.620
What... What are you
trying to say, Marseille?

00:07:55.620 --> 00:07:57.240
Just what it sounds like.

00:07:57.240 --> 00:08:01.160
You're not good enough
to fight with me, Captain.

00:08:01.160 --> 00:08:02.000
Captain...

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:04.710
The only one who is...

00:08:09.050 --> 00:08:11.260
Where do you think
you're looking, Marseille?

00:08:11.260 --> 00:08:13.800
Your disrespect for your superior officers

00:08:13.800 --> 00:08:19.720
hasn't changed since the Battle of Karlsland!

00:08:21.390 --> 00:08:22.430
What should we do?

00:08:22.680 --> 00:08:23.810
Captain Barkhorn.

00:08:24.640 --> 00:08:26.810
We're the same rank now.

00:08:40.790 --> 00:08:42.040
Take it outside!

00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:43.000
Both of you!

00:08:44.500 --> 00:08:46.120
Stop!

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:50.090
I'll be Marseille's partner.

00:08:50.090 --> 00:08:51.130
That takes care of it, right?

00:08:55.930 --> 00:08:57.430
Lieutenant Hartmann...

00:08:57.930 --> 00:08:58.970
Hartmann.

00:08:59.260 --> 00:09:00.260
Okay.

00:09:00.640 --> 00:09:03.310
I'm looking forward to it, Hartmann.

00:09:21.910 --> 00:09:23.910
They're both amazing!

00:09:23.910 --> 00:09:26.580
Both of them are top aces in Karlsland.

00:09:27.170 --> 00:09:29.790
Is this operation...

00:09:29.790 --> 00:09:34.630
Yes. It's an inter-squad, joint operation for top aces only.

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:39.590
The allied brass brought
in Captain Marseille

00:09:39.590 --> 00:09:41.510
as a publicity stunt to help the operation.

00:09:43.010 --> 00:09:45.310
If the operation succeeds,

00:09:45.310 --> 00:09:47.520
then I've got no room to complain.

00:09:48.020 --> 00:09:50.110
But it looks like that'll be
difficult, as things stand.

00:09:50.110 --> 00:09:53.400
Yeah. They're not working together at all.

00:10:03.700 --> 00:10:05.200
That's my ninth win!

00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:11.420
Oh, no! She got me!

00:10:12.790 --> 00:10:14.800
Enough, both of you!

00:10:15.510 --> 00:10:17.050
Return to base immediately!

00:10:17.510 --> 00:10:18.720
Right, right.

00:10:23.640 --> 00:10:25.470
I wonder if something happened.

00:10:25.470 --> 00:10:28.980
I dunno, I couldn't really see.

00:10:42.200 --> 00:10:44.240
You two will spend your days in here,

00:10:44.240 --> 00:10:45.990
until the operation starts.

00:10:45.990 --> 00:10:49.660
Normally, Captain Marseille
would be on her way to the brig

00:10:49.660 --> 00:10:51.540
for pointing a gun at
someone during training.

00:10:51.540 --> 00:10:54.630
But unfortunately, we
don't have one at this base.

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:58.510
Instead you'll stay here.

00:10:58.510 --> 00:11:01.380
Hey, why am I here, too?

00:11:01.380 --> 00:11:02.890
It's a good opportunity.

00:11:02.890 --> 00:11:04.720
Stay in the same room,

00:11:04.720 --> 00:11:07.520
and learn to cooperate
a little, before the mission.

00:11:07.850 --> 00:11:08.770
Understood?

00:11:09.230 --> 00:11:10.520
Yes, ma'am.

00:11:10.520 --> 00:11:11.100
Understood.

00:11:11.600 --> 00:11:13.900
You won't be so lucky
if this happens again.

00:11:20.610 --> 00:11:22.820
They got mad at me
because of you, Hanna.

00:11:24.870 --> 00:11:26.740
Minna's one scary lady!

00:11:26.740 --> 00:11:29.620
She's even scarier
when she's really mad.

00:11:34.830 --> 00:11:36.380
Why didn't you fight back?

00:11:37.630 --> 00:11:39.670
When I aimed at you back there...

00:11:39.670 --> 00:11:44.050
You're good enough to have dodged or counterattacked.

00:11:44.390 --> 00:11:46.300
You never change.

00:11:46.760 --> 00:11:48.430
I have no need to.

00:11:48.430 --> 00:11:51.020
Why are you so obsessed
with winning and losing?

00:11:52.100 --> 00:11:55.060
On the battlefield, victory is the only thing that matters.

00:11:55.060 --> 00:11:58.480
So I'll keep winning, and I'll keep being the strongest.

00:11:58.480 --> 00:11:59.480
That's all.

00:12:00.110 --> 00:12:01.070
The heck?

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:03.280
When we were in the same squad,

00:12:03.280 --> 00:12:05.070
my record against you was 8-8.

00:12:05.070 --> 00:12:09.370
You were the only one
who was my equal, Erica.

00:12:09.370 --> 00:12:13.370
So I want to finish things
during this operation.

00:12:16.710 --> 00:12:18.590
Then fine. You win.

00:12:18.590 --> 00:12:19.380
Again?

00:12:19.880 --> 00:12:23.050
You said the same thing
last time, and then you fled!

00:12:23.050 --> 00:12:23.800
Why?

00:12:24.840 --> 00:12:26.470
'Cause it's a pain in the butt.

00:12:41.740 --> 00:12:42.150
Wait!

00:12:42.900 --> 00:12:44.950
First, Captain Marseille!

00:12:52.160 --> 00:12:53.540
I win.

00:12:55.620 --> 00:12:56.460
One more.

00:12:56.460 --> 00:12:57.500
Okay!

00:12:59.340 --> 00:13:02.210
Um, do you like Fuso food?

00:13:02.210 --> 00:13:06.380
Yeah. There's a Fuso
Witch in my squad, too.

00:13:10.970 --> 00:13:12.470
But I can't handle that stuff.

00:13:12.470 --> 00:13:13.560
What?

00:13:13.560 --> 00:13:15.480
Natto's good for you.

00:13:15.480 --> 00:13:16.770
One more.

00:13:18.020 --> 00:13:20.320
Th-There's no more rice.

00:13:20.320 --> 00:13:21.360
What?

00:13:22.440 --> 00:13:23.860
I win!

00:13:30.950 --> 00:13:32.330
I won twice.

00:13:32.330 --> 00:13:33.950
We're not competing.

00:13:33.950 --> 00:13:36.460
Victory is the first thing,
and it's the only thing.

00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:38.580
I said, we aren't competing!

00:13:38.960 --> 00:13:43.420
Sheesh. That's why
you're still a lieutenant.

00:13:43.420 --> 00:13:45.590
I don't care.

00:13:49.050 --> 00:13:50.430
Baths are great.

00:13:50.430 --> 00:13:52.930
They relax your tight muscles.

00:13:52.930 --> 00:13:56.060
I'd heard rumors.
I guess they were true.

00:13:56.600 --> 00:13:58.390
There aren't baths in Africa?

00:14:00.060 --> 00:14:04.030
In Africa, a drop of water
is worth a drop of blood.

00:14:04.030 --> 00:14:06.190
You can't use it on things like that.

00:14:08.110 --> 00:14:09.780
Sounds hard.

00:14:09.780 --> 00:14:11.950
But Africa's a nice place.

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:14.580
No angry superiors,

00:14:14.580 --> 00:14:18.250
and those shady guys in the upper ranks mostly leave you alone.

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:21.460
Then why'd you agree to this operation?

00:14:21.840 --> 00:14:26.050
Eh, I'll give them their publicity stunt.

00:14:29.840 --> 00:14:33.970
If that keeps the Africa Squad safe, it's a small price to pay.

00:14:38.690 --> 00:14:42.690
And Erica Hartmann's part of the 501st.

00:14:43.650 --> 00:14:44.520
The heck?

00:14:47.610 --> 00:14:49.860
Marseille-san and Hartmann-san.

00:14:51.030 --> 00:14:53.490
How was your first bath?

00:14:54.410 --> 00:14:56.240
It was pretty good...

00:14:57.040 --> 00:14:58.580
Gotcha!

00:14:58.580 --> 00:15:00.790
Damn you! How dare
you get behind me?

00:15:01.420 --> 00:15:02.330
Big!

00:15:02.920 --> 00:15:05.380
But Shirley wins!

00:15:07.260 --> 00:15:09.010
Wha-? Impossible!

00:15:09.010 --> 00:15:10.220
I lose?

00:15:10.220 --> 00:15:11.510
Look!

00:15:11.510 --> 00:15:13.140
They're the shapeliest in the world!

00:15:14.720 --> 00:15:16.640
Shape's a matter of taste!

00:15:16.640 --> 00:15:18.680
Better than sagging.

00:15:19.640 --> 00:15:21.140
Who's sagging?

00:15:21.140 --> 00:15:22.650
See? They're as perky as you can get 'em!

00:15:22.650 --> 00:15:23.810
Yoshika-chan...

00:15:23.810 --> 00:15:24.520
See? They're as perky as you can get 'em!

00:15:24.730 --> 00:15:26.190
The heck?

00:15:37.120 --> 00:15:39.660
Hey, Trude, what's up?

00:15:40.040 --> 00:15:41.620
Um...

00:15:42.460 --> 00:15:44.790
No, it's nothing.

00:15:45.340 --> 00:15:48.170
Do you want Hanna's signature?

00:15:49.760 --> 00:15:51.340
It's not for me.

00:15:51.340 --> 00:15:53.590
My little sister's a fan.

00:15:53.590 --> 00:15:54.640
Chris is?

00:15:54.640 --> 00:15:57.930
S-So I thought it might make her happy...

00:15:58.640 --> 00:16:00.730
Okay, I'll ask her for you.

00:16:02.270 --> 00:16:02.940
No.

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:05.810
I don't give autographs.

00:16:05.810 --> 00:16:07.190
Why?

00:16:07.190 --> 00:16:09.400
Oh, giving an autograph won't kill you.

00:16:12.150 --> 00:16:16.410
I'm not signing anything for that sister-complex-having, rock-headed girl!

00:16:19.910 --> 00:16:21.160
Hey, Hanna.

00:16:21.910 --> 00:16:23.410
Don't say bad things about Trude!

00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:28.000
Then compete with me.

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:30.210
If you win, then I'll sign anything you want.

00:16:31.090 --> 00:16:32.510
You'll keep your word?

00:16:33.010 --> 00:16:34.010
Yeah.

00:16:37.800 --> 00:16:38.760
It's time.

00:17:08.960 --> 00:17:10.040
Can you hear me?

00:17:10.040 --> 00:17:11.300
Captain Marseille?

00:17:11.300 --> 00:17:12.460
Lieutenant Hartmann?

00:17:12.460 --> 00:17:13.590
Yeah, you're coming in fine.

00:17:21.810 --> 00:17:25.480
The target is Malta Island, which
has been taken over by the Neuroi.

00:17:25.480 --> 00:17:28.270
The Neuroi that attacked the Fuso fleet

00:17:28.270 --> 00:17:30.520
is believed to have come from here.

00:17:34.030 --> 00:17:36.070
The Neuroi has formed
a fortress above ground,

00:17:36.070 --> 00:17:37.450
and they'll be difficult to attack.

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:40.200
So we'll use a submarine to get you inside,

00:17:40.200 --> 00:17:41.620
and we'll defeat them from there.

00:17:41.620 --> 00:17:43.660
Are you both ready?

00:17:44.250 --> 00:17:45.540
Ready whenever.

00:17:45.960 --> 00:17:47.290
I'm ready, too.

00:17:48.580 --> 00:17:50.040
Commence operation!

00:17:57.300 --> 00:17:58.220
Launch!

00:18:08.140 --> 00:18:09.440
There are so many!

00:18:10.350 --> 00:18:12.480
Probably about forty of them!

00:18:13.020 --> 00:18:14.530
Forty?

00:18:14.530 --> 00:18:15.440
That's a lot.

00:18:15.440 --> 00:18:17.360
No, thirty-eight.

00:18:17.360 --> 00:18:18.530
Thirty-five.

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:19.820
Which is it?

00:18:20.360 --> 00:18:22.160
No, they're both right.

00:18:22.160 --> 00:18:23.330
The enemy is decreasing in number.

00:18:24.830 --> 00:18:26.660
They're taking them down.

00:18:27.620 --> 00:18:28.830
Twenty-eight.

00:18:29.370 --> 00:18:30.290
Twenty-five.

00:18:33.040 --> 00:18:33.750
Twenty-one.

00:18:34.670 --> 00:18:35.250
Ten!

00:18:42.800 --> 00:18:43.640
Seven!

00:18:44.310 --> 00:18:45.180
Six!

00:18:45.930 --> 00:18:46.680
Five!

00:18:47.020 --> 00:18:47.930
Four!

00:18:48.100 --> 00:18:48.890
Three!

00:18:49.310 --> 00:18:50.190
Two!

00:18:52.560 --> 00:18:53.400
Zero!

00:18:53.820 --> 00:18:54.860
Now all that's left is the core!

00:18:56.190 --> 00:18:56.980
This is it!

00:18:56.980 --> 00:18:57.990
Got it!

00:19:06.080 --> 00:19:07.870
Look at that!

00:19:08.250 --> 00:19:10.620
Wow. Just the two of them...

00:19:11.210 --> 00:19:12.330
I took out twenty-five.

00:19:12.330 --> 00:19:13.840
Same.

00:19:14.880 --> 00:19:16.300
I don't like ties.

00:19:16.300 --> 00:19:17.630
I know.

00:19:18.210 --> 00:19:19.630
We're going to finish this.

00:19:20.590 --> 00:19:22.890
If I win, you sign the picture.

00:19:24.180 --> 00:19:25.640
<i>If</i> you win.

00:19:27.890 --> 00:19:30.230
What are they doing?

00:19:47.410 --> 00:19:48.700
She shot at her!

00:19:49.080 --> 00:19:50.500
Yeah, she did.

00:19:50.500 --> 00:19:51.290
That girl...

00:19:52.080 --> 00:19:54.290
How can she shoot at an ally?

00:19:54.750 --> 00:19:56.540
There's no helping those two.

00:19:56.540 --> 00:19:59.380
How can you be so relaxed!

00:19:59.380 --> 00:20:00.760
Those are real bullets!

00:20:00.760 --> 00:20:02.090
They're Witches.

00:20:02.090 --> 00:20:04.970
They have shields, so
the bullets won't hit them.

00:20:05.720 --> 00:20:06.800
Yeah, but...

00:20:06.800 --> 00:20:11.980
But in their fight, the first
to use the shield loses.

00:20:11.980 --> 00:20:15.310
And the first to run out of bullets loses.

00:20:30.910 --> 00:20:33.120
She tried to cut her off with a chandelle,

00:20:33.120 --> 00:20:36.460
but she did a high-G barrel
roll and got behind her!

00:20:37.340 --> 00:20:38.340
Amazing.

00:20:44.630 --> 00:20:45.340
Gotcha!

00:20:48.140 --> 00:20:49.220
<i>Sturm!</i>

00:21:08.070 --> 00:21:09.280
I'm out of bullets.

00:21:09.280 --> 00:21:10.160
So am I.

00:21:11.450 --> 00:21:12.410
It's a tie.

00:21:15.370 --> 00:21:18.500
Then they didn't settle things...

00:21:40.610 --> 00:21:43.280
What brought this on?

00:21:43.280 --> 00:21:45.570
You're actually cleaning your room.

00:21:46.240 --> 00:21:47.740
I'm sorry, Trude.

00:21:47.740 --> 00:21:50.030
I couldn't get Hanna's signature.

00:21:53.160 --> 00:21:54.370
It's all right.

00:21:54.370 --> 00:21:55.660
Don't worry about it.

00:21:57.920 --> 00:21:59.460
You're in a big hurry.

00:22:00.170 --> 00:22:03.050
I've got a magazine
interview this afternoon.

00:22:03.050 --> 00:22:05.130
I guess that's the Star of Africa for you.

00:22:05.340 --> 00:22:07.800
Oh, right. I forgot this.

00:22:09.680 --> 00:22:12.310
Send this to Barkhorn's
little sister, would you?

00:22:13.810 --> 00:22:17.180
You should just give it to Trude yourself.

00:22:17.480 --> 00:22:18.730
I told you, didn't I?

00:22:20.770 --> 00:22:22.900
I'm busy.

00:22:30.990 --> 00:22:32.780
Eh, never mind!

00:22:37.000 --> 00:22:40.000
To Be Continued

00:24:11.170 --> 00:24:13.720
At last, the final battle
with the Neuroi is upon us.

00:24:14.390 --> 00:24:15.970
I'll fight to the end,

00:24:15.970 --> 00:24:18.850
as a member of the Strike Witches.

00:24:19.010 --> 00:24:23.020
Next time on <i>Strike Witches 2:</i>
To Be Myself.
